# BondhuChat

BondhuChat is a Cloudflare-first private messaging application with secure authentication, persistent chat history, real-time messaging, and one-to-one WebRTC audio/video calls.

## Setup

```bash
npm install
cp .env.example .env
```

## Scripts

```bash
npm run dev:worker
npm run dev:frontend
npm run build
npm test
```

## Local runtime

- Frontend: http://localhost:5173
- API: http://localhost:8787

## Environment variables

- `VITE_API_BASE` — frontend API base URL
- `JWT_SECRET` — server secret (if using JWT-based session tokens)
- `TURN_URL` / `TURN_USERNAME` / `TURN_PASSWORD` — optional relay configuration
- `R2_BUCKET` — optional attachments bucket name
